urges by Most Since Mining Boom on Data Centers&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-capex-surges-by-most-since-mining-boom-on-data-centers</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:01:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 卢拉提议布拉德斯科的路易斯·特拉布科加入他的政府</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government</link><description>据知情人士透露，总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦已向布拉德斯科主席路易斯·卡洛斯·特拉布科·卡皮试探加入其第四届政府，此举可能有助于缓解投资者对巴西不断恶化的财政前景的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government'&gt;卢拉提议布拉德斯科的路易斯·特拉布科加入他的政府&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Lula Sounds Out Bradesco’s Luiz Trabuco to Join His Government&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:07:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 对冲基金不再只是富人的专利。他们是为日常投资者而来</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/hedge-funds-retail-investors.html</link><description>随着该行业寻求新的增长途径，对冲基金越来越多地吸引散户投资者。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/hedge-funds-retail-investors.html'&gt;对冲基金不再只是富人的专利。他们是为日常投资者而来&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hedge funds are no longer just for the rich. They’re coming for everyday investors&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/hedge-funds-retail-investors.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:10:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 《华尔街日报》称，第三季度态势感知能力下降了 65%</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/situational-awareness-ai-65-hedge-fund-third-quarter-wsj-says</link><description>据《华尔街日报》报道，Situational Awareness 告诉投资者，在对人工智能公司的高杠杆押注几乎导致该对冲基金 7 月份破产后，该公司第三季度扣除费用后损失了 65%。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/situational-awareness-ai-65-hedge-fund-third-quarter-wsj-says'&gt;《华尔街日报》称，第三季度态势感知能力下降了 65%&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Situational Awareness Lost 65% in Wild Third Quarter, WSJ Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/situational-awareness-ai-65-hedge-fund-third-quarter-wsj-says</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:11:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 策略师表示，在印度央行介入之前，卢比还有上涨空间</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-rally-has-91-in-sight-as-rbi-seen-holding-back-dollar-buys</link><description>印度卢比正在脱离其亚洲货币，策略师表示，在央行介入购买美元之前，卢比的涨势还会进一步扩大。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-rally-has-91-in-sight-as-rbi-seen-holding-back-dollar-buys'&gt;策略师表示，在印度央行介入之前，卢比还有上涨空间&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rupee Has Room to Rally Before RBI Steps In, Strategists Say&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-rally-has-91-in-sight-as-rbi-seen-holding-back-dollar-buys</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] Shein 在印度的缓慢起步暴露了亿万富翁安巴尼零售实力的局限性</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/shein-s-slow-india-start-lays-bare-limits-of-billionaire-ambani-s-retail-might</link><description>Shein Global Holdings Ltd. 通过当地合作伙伴重返印度的计划起步缓慢，原因是供应链障碍、领导层的不确定性以及缺乏使这个快时尚品牌大受欢迎的专有技术。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/shein-s-slow-india-start-lays-bare-limits-of-billionaire-ambani-s-retail-might'&gt;Shein 在印度的缓慢起步暴露